sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Client A
    participant B as Client B
    participant P as PgBouncer (session mode)
    participant S1 as Backend 1234
    participant S2 as Backend 5678

    A->>P: connect
    P-->>A: Backend 1234 is assigned to A until A disconnects
    A->>P: query
    P->>S1: query
    A->>P: query
    P->>S1: query
    B->>P: connect
    P-->>B: Backend 5678 is assigned to B until B disconnects
    B->>P: query
    P->>S2: query
    A->>P: disconnect
    P->>S1: DISCARD ALL (server_reset_query)
    Note over S1: Back in the pool, clean session
